    "title": "Brazil \u2014 country-wide tiled overview",
    "description": "Country-wide tiled overview of the Brazil field-boundary predictions: all 55,500,520 field polygons from the BR_* partitions in one multi-scale PMTiles archive. Zooms 0\u20138 carry an `aggregate` layer of A5 grid cells (resolution 5 at z0\u20135, resolution 8 at z6\u20138) with per-cell rollups: `count`, `sum_area`, `avg_area`, `max_area`, `avg_perimeter` (m\u00b2/m, from `metrics:*`), per-year counts (`count_2024`, `count_2025`) and per-subdivision counts (`count_<code>`). From z9 a `features` layer carries the individual field polygons (properties: `id`, `area`, `perimeter`, `state`, `year`) through z13. Built with geoparquet-io (A5 aggregation) and tylertoo (tiling); cell rollups are exact sums, not thinned samples.",
